       }
      ],
      "text": "Retinoids:"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 36,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": {
      "rule": "auto",
      "value": 1
     },
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": null
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "-    Topical (comedonal + mild papulopustular/mixed acne): tretinoin (start 0.025% cream twice wkly @ night → ⇡freq to once nightly if tolerable), adapalene; tazarotene (FDA-approved for plaque psoriasis, acne vulgaris, + photoaging (adjunctive palliation))"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 36,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": {
      "rule": "auto",
      "value": 1
     },
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": null
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "-    Isotretinoin (severe acne ⍉responding to topical/PO tx; USU reserved for severe or refractory acne): 20-wk course; ~20% of pts relapse w/in 3 yrs + require a 2nd round; daily dosing over intermittent (lidose or strd)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 36,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": {
      "rule": "auto",
      "value": 1
     },
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": null
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "-    MOA (isotretinoin): shrinks sebaceous glands; marked attenuation of sebum secretion; inhibits the sebum-dependent bacterium Cutibacterium acnes"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 36,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": {
      "rule": "auto",
      "value": 1
     },
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": null
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "-    ⍉ in preg (teratogenic → spont abortions + congenital malformations); must enroll in iPledge, receive regular preg tests, + use 2 forms of contraception"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 36,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": {
      "rule": "auto",
      "value": 1
     },
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": null
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "-    SE: dry skin & lips (MC), dry eyes; ↑TG & cholest; arthralgias, myalgias, hepatitis, leukopenia, premature long bone closure; photosensitivity, worsening of DM, HA, idiopathic IC HTN, fatigue, possibly psychiatric"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 36,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
